#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``cv::StereoSGBM`` runs on the gray "
#~ "images, padded left and right so "
#~ "the search window never runs off "
#~ "the image. It reports 1/16 px "
#~ "fixed point with ``(minDisparity - 1)"
#~ " * 16`` marking \"no match\". The "
#~ "pipeline unpacks to float, drops values"
#~ " outside the configured window, and "
#~ "checks left-right consistency with a "
#~ "bilinear sample of the right-view "
#~ "map at :math:`x - d`."
